00:23:53.259 --> 00:23:54.259
Brainiac is behind everything.

00:23:54.259 --> 00:23:56.259
I know, and now he's taken over Chloe.

00:23:56.259 --> 00:23:58.259
I had a visitor. She seemed to know

00:23:58.259 --> 00:23:59.259
a lot about all of us.

00:23:59.259 --> 00:24:00.259
Imra?

00:24:00.259 --> 00:24:03.259
I'm searching the global power grid for power surges anywhere in the world.

00:24:03.259 --> 00:24:05.259
Hopefully that will lead us to Brainiac.

00:24:05.259 --> 00:24:10.259
Clark, that girl said the only way to stop Brainiac is to kill his host.

00:24:10.259 --> 00:24:14.759
Oh, she's right.

00:24:14.759 --> 00:24:20.029
Lana, I have always put my loved ones before everything.

00:24:20.029 --> 00:24:26.660
But this time I'm putting Chloe's well-being before the lives of billions of people.

00:24:26.660 --> 00:24:34.380
I may have been gone a while, but the Clark I know would never doubt himself.

00:24:34.380 --> 00:24:35.380
Lana.

00:24:35.380 --> 00:24:36.380
He would never waver.

00:24:36.380 --> 00:24:37.380
waiver.

00:24:37.380 --> 00:25:36.140
He would insist that he could save Chloe's life and the rest of the world.

00:25:36.140 --> 00:25:37.140
It's a power search.

00:25:37.140 --> 00:25:40.140
Showing a voltage spike somewhere in downtown metropolis.

00:25:40.140 --> 00:25:41.140
Can you pinpoint the address?

00:25:41.140 --> 00:25:46.180
Looks like it's coming from the Daily Planet.

00:25:46.180 --> 00:25:47.180
It makes sense.

00:25:47.180 --> 00:25:48.180
It's the hub of information.

00:25:48.180 --> 00:25:53.890
Mauna.

00:25:53.890 --> 00:25:58.450
Mauna, can you hear me?

00:25:58.450 --> 00:26:09.339
Beautiful.

00:26:09.339 --> 00:26:10.339
Pain.

00:26:10.339 --> 00:26:11.339
Acute.

00:26:11.339 --> 00:26:13.339
Psychotry.

00:26:13.339 --> 00:26:14.339
Hey, Clover.

00:26:14.339 --> 00:26:19.980
Nice try, telepath.

00:26:19.980 --> 00:26:26.019
Hercedism's historic where I come from.

00:26:26.019 --> 00:26:29.019
So is your defeat.

00:26:29.019 --> 00:26:34.130
Well, history's about to get a re-ray.

00:26:34.130 --> 00:26:42.660
Nice sink up.

00:26:42.660 --> 00:26:43.660
For once.

00:26:43.660 --> 00:26:45.660
Let's your magnetism.

00:26:45.660 --> 00:26:47.660
That pulse can crash any computer.

00:26:47.660 --> 00:26:48.660
Now we need to pull the plug.

00:26:48.660 --> 00:26:49.660
You okay him?

00:26:49.660 --> 00:26:52.660
Fine, aside from a splitting headache.

00:26:52.660 --> 00:26:59.559
I'm picking up the level brain activity.

00:26:59.559 --> 00:27:03.859
We don't have much time.

00:27:03.859 --> 00:27:05.859
Not even just the rest of the world.

00:27:05.859 --> 00:27:07.859
What's Priniak doing?

00:27:07.859 --> 00:27:09.859
Using human brainwave entrainment.

00:27:09.859 --> 00:27:12.240
He's downloading every last.

00:27:12.240 --> 00:27:14.240
every last bite of their knowledge,

00:27:14.240 --> 00:27:38.640
one mind at a time.

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.640
I'll do it.

00:27:39.640 --> 00:27:42.460
No.

00:27:42.460 --> 00:27:44.460
When I joined the Legion, I pledge an oath to do whatever it took.

00:27:44.460 --> 00:28:00.940
And I'm gonna honor that for once.

00:28:00.940 --> 00:28:05.599
It's okay, Karth. Give me the knife.

00:28:05.599 --> 00:28:19.019
What are you doing?

00:28:19.019 --> 00:28:21.019
We powered him down with an electromagnetic pulse,

00:28:21.019 --> 00:28:23.019
but he will be back online within minutes.

00:28:23.019 --> 00:28:24.019
So we need to...

00:28:24.019 --> 00:28:25.019
Don't touch her.

00:28:25.019 --> 00:28:27.019
Cal, whoever your friend was, she's not there anymore.

00:28:27.019 --> 00:28:34.980
Do you power them down too?

00:28:34.980 --> 00:28:36.980
No, Braini could take credit for that.

00:28:36.980 --> 00:28:38.980
Kalel, we need to shut Brainiac down,

00:28:38.980 --> 00:28:40.980
And for that, the host has to die.

00:28:40.980 --> 00:28:42.980
Does your legion have any principles?

00:28:42.980 --> 00:28:44.980
You speak of a code.

00:28:44.980 --> 00:28:46.980
But if it had anything to do with me,

00:28:46.980 --> 00:28:48.980
rule number one would be do not kill.

00:28:48.980 --> 00:28:49.980
Ever!

00:28:49.980 --> 00:28:50.980
Kowel.

00:28:50.980 --> 00:28:52.980
If you ever believed in me.

00:28:52.980 --> 00:28:54.980
And even if you don't now, help me.

00:28:54.980 --> 00:28:56.980
There's a human being inside there.

00:28:56.980 --> 00:29:00.420
We need to help her.

00:29:00.420 --> 00:29:05.710
And together, I think we can.

00:29:05.710 --> 00:29:06.710
Rock.

00:29:06.710 --> 00:29:12.490
Cal's right. Chloe's there.

00:29:12.490 --> 00:29:32.599
I can hear her.

00:29:32.599 --> 00:29:33.599
What are we doing here?

00:29:33.599 --> 00:29:34.599
We're running out of time.

00:29:34.599 --> 00:29:39.170
With Brainiac rebutes, I don't want him near any computer networks.

00:29:40.170 --> 00:29:42.170
What do you want us to do?

00:29:42.170 --> 00:29:43.170
Work together.

00:29:43.170 --> 00:29:46.170
All of us. I want to try to connect with Chloe.

00:29:46.170 --> 00:29:48.170
Imra, can you do that?

00:29:48.170 --> 00:29:51.220
I'll try.

00:29:51.220 --> 00:29:55.690
Between the two of you, I think we can neutralize Brainiac.

00:29:55.690 --> 00:29:58.690
An electromagnetic blast only lasts so long.

00:29:58.690 --> 00:29:59.690
He's a computer.

00:29:59.690 --> 00:30:02.690
Whatever microscopic parts he's made out of, they're probably metal, right?

00:30:02.690 --> 00:30:04.690
I've never focused my powers like this before,

00:30:04.690 --> 00:30:06.690
but I can try to magnetically extract the nanites.

00:30:06.690 --> 00:30:08.690
I could short-circuit him with a static attack.

00:30:08.690 --> 00:30:10.690
attack.

00:30:10.690 --> 00:30:12.690
Get ready for a techno-exorcism.

00:30:12.690 --> 00:30:14.690
I've got her.

00:30:14.690 --> 00:30:15.690
Cal.

00:30:15.690 --> 00:30:17.690
She's asking for you.

00:30:17.690 --> 00:30:19.690
Chloe?

00:30:19.690 --> 00:30:20.690
Chloe, I'm here.

00:30:20.690 --> 00:30:26.250
Chloe, we're gonna try to get rid of Brainiac, okay?

00:30:26.250 --> 00:30:32.410
Just hang on.

00:30:32.410 --> 00:30:33.410
Brainiac's fighting.

00:30:33.410 --> 00:30:35.410
He's coming back online.

00:30:35.410 --> 00:30:36.410
Rock, no!

00:30:36.410 --> 00:32:03.240
Can you hear anything?

00:32:03.240 --> 00:32:04.240
Chloe.

00:32:04.240 --> 00:32:22.779
I'm getting something.

00:32:22.779 --> 00:32:24.779
I definitely feel a whole lot dumber.

00:32:24.779 --> 00:32:59.420
It's nice to see the kinder, gentler Chloe.

00:32:59.420 --> 00:33:06.420
Nothing like having a binary bad guy cleanse from your system to put a springback in your step.

00:33:06.420 --> 00:33:10.420
But I'll feel even better once I get to Star City to see my husband.

00:33:10.420 --> 00:33:13.420
I'm going to relieve Lois of her nurse's duties.

00:33:13.420 --> 00:33:15.420
It was nice of Lois to take care of Jimmy, though.

00:33:15.420 --> 00:33:18.420
I think he'd rather have his temperature taken by you.

00:33:18.420 --> 00:33:20.420
Yeah, I'm just glad he's okay.

00:33:20.420 --> 00:33:23.420
From what I hear, he was lucky to make it past that creature alive.

00:33:23.420 --> 00:33:26.420
Whether that destroyer was, I haven't seen a sign of him since.

00:33:26.420 --> 00:33:30.049
He was definitely linked to Brainiac.

00:33:30.049 --> 00:33:31.049
Hopefully he was.

00:33:31.049 --> 00:33:33.049
powered down along with Brainiac.

00:33:33.049 --> 00:33:38.150
So, how's your memory?

00:33:38.150 --> 00:33:40.150
It's fine.

00:33:40.150 --> 00:33:44.150
Up until here comes the bride, then it's all a bit of a blur.

00:33:44.150 --> 00:33:47.430
You don't remember anything unusual about me?

00:33:47.430 --> 00:33:53.779
Are we talking about your secret?

00:33:53.779 --> 00:33:55.779
Clerk, what in the world would make me forget that?

00:33:55.779 --> 00:34:00.119
Chloe, you've been through a lot lately.

00:34:00.119 --> 00:34:04.119
It would take a lot more than Brainiac to wipe that from my memory.

00:34:04.119 --> 00:34:12.780
Thanks for not giving up on me.

00:34:12.780 --> 00:34:17.449
I'd never give up on you, Chloe. You know that.

00:34:17.449 --> 00:34:22.650
I just hope that if it turned out that there was

00:34:22.650 --> 00:34:28.239
was no other choice, you would choose to do the right thing.

00:34:28.239 --> 00:34:32.900
What choice would that be?

00:34:32.900 --> 00:34:34.900
To do what's best for the world.

00:34:34.900 --> 00:34:38.269
But not for me.

00:34:38.269 --> 00:34:39.269
Know that I'd understand.

00:34:39.269 --> 00:35:11.969
Well, as long as I'm around, that's never going to happen.

00:35:11.969 --> 00:35:15.969
Oh, hi. Um, I was looking for Clark.

00:35:15.969 --> 00:35:18.969
The boys are out fixing the barn.

00:35:18.969 --> 00:35:24.619
Thanks. Emirat.

00:35:24.619 --> 00:35:30.099
I understand that you're only doing what you thought was best.

00:35:30.099 --> 00:35:32.099
We were willing to take the easy way out.

00:35:32.099 --> 00:35:37.099
But Calell, he never gave up.

00:35:37.099 --> 00:35:42.630
You know, it's true what history says about him.

00:35:42.630 --> 00:35:45.630
He really does bring out the best in people.

00:35:45.630 --> 00:35:52.280
You're very lucky.

00:35:52.280 --> 00:35:54.280
I probably shouldn't be asking this, but...

00:35:54.280 --> 00:35:56.280
You're curious about you and Clark.

00:35:56.280 --> 00:35:59.880
I couldn't help but wonder about us.

00:35:59.880 --> 00:36:02.880
About where we go from here.

00:36:02.880 --> 00:36:05.880
Well, that's for you two to discover yourselves.

00:36:05.880 --> 00:36:10.630
But I will tell you this, Lana.

00:36:10.630 --> 00:36:13.070
You remember you.

00:36:13.070 --> 00:36:18.800
remembered for a lot more than just your relationship with Callow.

00:36:18.800 --> 00:36:25.920
Leave a destiny all your own.

00:36:25.920 --> 00:36:26.920
Your secret's safe with me.

00:36:26.920 --> 00:36:48.699
Holy Sprock.

00:36:48.699 --> 00:36:50.699
I read about this.

00:36:50.699 --> 00:36:52.699
You don't read. I told you about that.

00:36:52.699 --> 00:36:54.699
It's one of the artifacts they could never find.

00:36:54.699 --> 00:36:56.699
The first baseball you ever hit.

00:36:56.699 --> 00:36:58.699
One clear across Smallville.

00:36:58.699 --> 00:36:59.699
You're right.

00:36:59.699 --> 00:37:01.699
My dad spent hours walking the fields.

00:37:01.699 --> 00:37:03.699
You finally found it on the other side of town.

00:37:03.699 --> 00:37:05.699
Hey, do you think I could keep this?

00:37:05.699 --> 00:37:07.699
Like as a souvenir?

00:37:07.699 --> 00:37:08.699
Sure.

00:37:08.699 --> 00:37:09.699
Could you sign it?

00:37:09.699 --> 00:37:10.699
you're acting like a sub.

00:37:10.699 --> 00:37:11.699
What?

00:37:11.699 --> 00:37:12.699
It's for my sister.

00:37:12.699 --> 00:37:23.329
Mm-hmm.

00:37:23.329 --> 00:37:24.329
Thanks.

00:37:24.329 --> 00:37:25.329
Hey, guys.

00:37:25.329 --> 00:37:29.659
It looks brand new.

00:37:29.659 --> 00:37:32.659
I guess it's time to go home.

00:37:32.659 --> 00:37:35.659
You sure you want to take that with you?

00:37:35.659 --> 00:37:39.659
I'm sure we'll be able to reprogram what's left of Brainiac

00:37:39.659 --> 00:37:42.659
into something useful.

00:37:42.659 --> 00:37:47.059
Let's hope Brainiac 5 is a little more friendly.

00:37:47.059 --> 00:37:50.059
I'm sorry I doubted you, Cal.

00:37:50.059 --> 00:37:53.059
You did stop Brainiac and without taking a life.

00:37:53.059 --> 00:37:55.059
There's always a way, Rock.

00:37:55.059 --> 00:37:57.059
If it ever seems like there isn't,

00:37:57.059 --> 00:38:00.059
just remember what we accomplished here today.

00:38:00.059 --> 00:38:02.059
Preserve life at all costs.

00:38:02.059 --> 00:38:05.059
That will be the number one rule in Legion code from now on.

00:38:05.059 --> 00:38:12.019
It truly was an honor.

00:38:12.019 --> 00:38:16.019
And if you ever want to meet the rest of the Legion,

00:38:16.019 --> 00:38:18.019
just put this ring on.

00:38:18.019 --> 00:38:23.489
I've reprogramed it for time travel only.

00:38:23.489 --> 00:38:26.489
No flights? Not yet.

00:38:26.489 --> 00:38:27.489
So?

00:38:27.489 --> 00:38:29.489
Looks like you're gonna have to learn to fly without training wheels.

00:38:29.489 --> 00:38:30.489
wheels.

00:38:30.489 --> 00:38:32.489
Just focus on 3009.

00:38:32.489 --> 00:38:34.489
We'll be there to greet you.

00:38:34.489 --> 00:38:35.489
Thanks.

00:38:35.489 --> 00:38:40.309
But I think I'll stick closer to my time zone for a while.

00:38:40.309 --> 00:38:48.550
We do hope we see you again.

00:38:48.550 --> 00:39:03.610
Be careful in the days ahead.

00:39:03.610 --> 00:39:43.949
Long will live the Legion.

00:39:43.949 --> 00:39:48.460
I didn't think you were much for jewelry.

00:39:48.460 --> 00:39:49.460
I'm not.

00:39:49.460 --> 00:39:50.460
It's going away gift.

00:39:50.460 --> 00:39:56.880
It's strange to meet people who know exactly where you're going,

00:39:56.880 --> 00:40:01.929
exactly when you're going to get there.

00:40:01.929 --> 00:40:03.929
Well, they don't know everything.

00:40:03.929 --> 00:40:06.929
And if they did, Chloe wouldn't be alive right now.

00:40:06.929 --> 00:40:12.260
Unfortunately, they didn't have what I had.

00:40:12.260 --> 00:40:18.119
Human parents who taught me more than just how to use my abilities.

00:40:18.119 --> 00:40:25.500
They have a different role model.

00:40:25.500 --> 00:40:29.500
With everything I've learned, everything I've been through.

00:40:29.500 --> 00:40:32.500
Apparently, I'm just getting started.

00:40:32.500 --> 00:40:35.500
According to the Legion,

00:40:35.500 --> 00:40:39.500
I will accomplish things so legendary I'll be known throughout the galaxy.

00:40:39.500 --> 00:40:51.579
You're not sure that you'll be able to live up to that.

00:40:51.579 --> 00:40:52.579
Clark.

00:40:52.579 --> 00:40:59.420
There is no doubt in my mind that you will.

00:40:59.420 --> 00:41:01.420
Just do it on your schedule, not theirs.

00:41:01.420 --> 00:41:07.659
Whether they happen to mention anything about your place in history?

00:41:07.659 --> 00:41:09.659
A little.

00:41:09.659 --> 00:41:13.639
The way I see it, it doesn't really matter.

00:41:13.639 --> 00:41:19.369
Our destiny is not written in some book in the future.

00:41:19.369 --> 00:41:27.619
We write it ourselves every day.

00:41:27.619 --> 00:41:30.619
And the question is, what we write next?

